  "design": {
    "idea": "Third-Story Tide Gallery Hub: peer through the central glass skylight toward r1 below and r17 above, raise tower_tide to high so the west mirror-raft floats onto the optical plane, rotate it to 45 deg, and bank a blue bolt across the basin to unlock the Dark-Glass Gallery (r16) for Key #3.",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ten",
    "teaches": "Multi-entrance upper tower hub using high tower_tide to activate reflect_only_floating mirror-rafts.",
    "decisions": 8,
    "expert_s": 50,
    "reward": "upper_hub+r16_access+r17_key_door",
    "why": "Converging upper hub connecting r7, r8, r16 (Hollow Wick), and r17 (Catoptric Mirror-Drum).",
